  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the vibrant ambiance of Pigment Tattoo And Laser, the cradle of new school ink artistry nestled at 12233 RR 620 North #111 in Austin, TX. As the go-to tattoo sanctuary, they effortlessly blend cutting-edge technique with personalized design, all while ensuring a sanitized, welcoming environment. Reach out at (512) 331-5476 to craft your next masterpiece or gift a transformation with their convenient gift cards.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Austin, Texas, United States"
